> Complete controls, cost and interpretation

Finite a>=0, positive degree, finite nonnegative relative tolerance and
nonnegative update budget below INT_MAX are checked before arithmetic. Nonfinite
or nonpositive produced seeds/ratios/states throw rather than propagating
unchecked infinities or NaNs. Identity and zero shortcuts are exact mathematical
cases; an exhausted approximate run remains explicitly unaccepted.

For I updates and degree through64, work is O(In), counting both attempted and
widened power-loop products. The large-degree branch uses O(I) log/exp
evaluations whose cost is not equated with multiplication. Ordinary driver
storage is constant. An owned trace retains four logical input controls and one
fixed record per actual update, default1000000, zero disabling; online admission
precedes each update. Metadata flags identify placeholders and arithmetic
routes, and no partial trace is returned on failure.

The Newton derivation and actual fixed-budget/default runs distinguish local
error reduction, numerical termination and representability guards. Full-domain
empirical/reference checks support the exercised cases without turning the
state-change threshold into a universal root-error or correct-rounding
certificate.

> Verification

This ten-report batch passes75 CTest cases,22 directly instrumented ASan/UBSan
cases,122 compiled and executed public examples,538/538 scoped documentation
definitions and ten representative clangd hovers. Independent Python
arbitrary-precision arithmetic verifies69365 captured division records
with656460 checks; native independent polynomial, geometry, finite-range, graph,
ranking and callback checks cover the remaining producers. Frozen valid-input
comparisons preserve Neville recurrences, Newton result/callback paths, complete
byte encodings, switch routes and NSGA-II complete objective-call
sequences/final fronts. Ten checkout headers and ten byte-identical installed
development headers compile independently; an installed-header native consumer
links and runs. All40 complete programs execute, and40 native figures have been
visually reviewed; HTML/Markdown exports preserve computed rows/prose and
identical image bytes. Checks are scoped native checks, not an installation
claim for every language binding. Receipts:
`build/mepml-conversion/batch-254-263/`.
